licant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MIYOSHI, NORIHISA</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NARUSE, KATSUTOSHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OSHITA, TAKAHIRO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SU, QINGQUAN</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KINOSHITA KAZUO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MIYOSHI NORIHISA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NARUSE KATSUTOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OSHITA TAKAHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SU QINGQUAN</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KINOSHITA, KAZUO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MIYOSHI, NORIHISA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NARUSE, KATSUTOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OSHITA, TAKAHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SU, QINGQUAN</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A method for the production of hydrogen having a gasification process (1) which gasifies a combusible material (a) and a gas treating process (1a) which purifies a gas (b) formed in the gasification process (1) to produce hydrogen, characterized in  that the gas treating process (1a) comprises a gas cleaning step (2) contacting the formed gas (b) obtained in the gasification process (1) with water or an alkaline solution to remove a dust and a trace amount of an acidic gas such as hydrogen chloride, hydrogen sulfide or the like from the gas by absorption, and a carbon monoxide adsorbing step (7) contacting the formed gas (b) having been cleaned in the gas cleaning step (2) with an adsorption agent for carbon monoxide to separate carbon monoxide from the gas. The method can be employed for recovering the chemical energy stored in a combustible material in the form of hydrogen gas and further converting it to electric energy with high efficiency.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur un procédé de production d'hydrogène dont le processus (1) de gazéification gazéifie une matière combustible (a) et dont le processus (1a) de traitement du gaz, formé au cours de ce processus, purifie un gaz (b) pour produire de l'hydrogène. Ce procédé de traitement du gaz (1a) se caractérise en ce qu'il comprend une étape (2) de purification du gaz consistant à mettre en contact le gaz (b) formé avec de l'eau ou une solution alcaline de façon à éliminer la poussière et une quantité de traces d'un gaz acide tel que le chlorure d'hydrogène, le sulfure d'hydrogène ou analogue provenant du gaz par absorption, et une étape (7) d'absorption du monoxyde de carbone consistant à mettre en contact le gaz (b) formé, et purifié dans l'étape (2), avec un agent d'absorption du monoxyde carbone pour séparer le monoxyde de carbone du gaz. Ce procédé peut être utilisé pour récupérer l'énergie chimique stockée dans une matière combustible sous forme de gaz hydrogène et la convertir ensuite en énergie électrique par un rendement élevé.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>